# Generated experiment artifacts (regenerate with scripts/run_campaign.py).
# Two campaigns are kept side by side: artifacts/ is the historical
# synchronized-clock baseline, artifacts_independent_clocks/ is the final
# campaign in which every recorder keeps its own clock. Neither is committed --
# they are hundreds of megabytes of recordings -- but the summary tables derived
# from them are, under docs/ and results/.
artifacts/**
!artifacts/.gitkeep
!artifacts/example/**
artifacts_independent_clocks/**
!artifacts_independent_clocks/.gitkeep
# The V2 campaign. Kept apart from the V1 roots above on purpose: V2 changed the
# sensors and the timing semantics, so a result averaged over both describes
# neither. scripts/run_campaign.py refuses a root holding both.
artifacts_v2/**
!artifacts_v2/.gitkeep
# Development and calibration runs, on seed 99. Kept out of artifacts_v2/ so that
# a threshold tuned here can never be tuned on a seed the final metrics are
# computed from, and untracked for the same reason as the roots above.
artifacts_v2_validation/**
!artifacts_v2_validation/.gitkeep

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

